%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ffd20afc55e26974198aa9b1c0c0eedf, type: 3}
  m_Name: Scene5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelSubtitleDialogueObject
  AudioClip:
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: Ringnig
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 795f427c74947774bac40e00da08df91, type: 3}
      volume: 0.86
      pitch: 1.566
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: (Ringing)
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 1
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 213bbe94c387b294c8015895ab09c5f8, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "Well, Well, I\u2019m back from my holiday, you must have missed
      me right? I\u2019m guessing you want to know where I went?"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 2
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 531533044b182a94eb13cfc192551061, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "This is the first holiday I have done since I started working
      here, so I decided to do something special. I went to the solar system. You
      know the origin point of mankind, isn\u2019t that cool?"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 3
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9a178d02741ea76428e6c41bf8ece046, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: ' I got to learn about our history on Earth, how we settled a planet
      called Mars and also found out about a devastating war that started because
      of some painter. It was really cool though.'
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 4
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 52eead9ea5b8b16488583636dc3cafc7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "I mean yeah I didn\u2019t have the money to go to the homeworld
      itself but I went to it\u2019s close neighbour called\u2026 what was it, Pluto
      I think so I was close enough. It was on discount and it was cold but I had
      a great time on my own. ...Just me"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 5
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 15168eab3b601594cb34a846f80cbac7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "Just me, only me\u2026"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 6
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a8245de873065a488bd8f771926ff9c, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: "\u2026"
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 7
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eab1d7af14ba1384a8f16505d86777a7, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: I need to call my ex-wife, Okay anyway what system is it this time
      oh yes. The 3 star System GW Orionis, quite the system, it's still quite a
      young one with lots of debris so make sure to keep an eye on it I guess.
  - AudioClip:
      nameClip: 8
      clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1172668256dbc21479562e825d0d957a, type: 3}
      volume: 1
      pitch: 1
      maxvol: 0
      loop: 0
      type: 1
      state: 0
      isPlaying: 0
    DialogueText: Anyway you should be fine, I have an important call to take from
      my superiors, go deliver already.
